OL,3,GNEWSACouncil adopts formal policy on AI
OL,4,Ause
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has adopted its first formal
OL,7,Fpolicy on artificial intelligence (AI),
OL,8,Fwith the aim of regulating use of the
OL,9,Ftechnology.
OL,11,FThe policy sets out rules and
OL,12,Fsafeguarding around the council's use
OL,13,Fof AI, including that any AI tool used
OL,14,Fmust be authorised for use by the
OL,15,Fauthority.
OL,17,FCouncillors and officers will not be
OL,18,Fallowed to use AI software accessed via
OL,19,Fthe internet, such as Gemini or
OL,20,FChatGPT, over data security concerns,
OL,21,Fthe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
