OL,3,GNEWSACouncil adopts formal policy on AI
OL,4,Ause
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe policy states anyone using AI for
OL,7,Fcouncil business must do so in a way
OL,8,Fthat is "safe, ethical, lawful and
OL,9,Fappropriate".
